<title>BELGIUM: Lauda Air to stop Belgium-Vienna flights.</title>
<headline>Lauda Air to stop Belgium-Vienna flights.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lauda Air will stop flying between Brussels and Vienna from May 11, a spokeswoman for the Austrian airline said.</p>
<p>According to industry sources, this move follows a new co-operative agreement between Lauda Air and Austrian Airlines .</p>
<p>Lauda Air operates three times daily from Brussels to Vienna.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706; fax +5017</p>
